  "reasoning": "The defendant cut down four water ash trees, which are a second‑level key protected plant, without approval from the forestry authority. This constitutes illegal cutting of protected trees, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as the crime of illegal logging of protected vegetation. The precedent answer for similar facts uses the term “滥伐林木”. No other offenses are indicated.",
